catflow 0.8
1. Read Index           kb.index
2. Embed                BGE-M3; "How many PTO days do new hires get?"
3. Retrieve     (1,2)   top_k=5
4. Gate         (2,3)   Ministral 3B; "Do the chunks answer it? tags: yes,
                        no"; max_visits=3; on_budget=yes
   -> { yes: 6 | no: 5 }
